                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Tekton plate example

A CLT box: four walls (t_wall) on centre-line dimensions plus a slab (t_slab) on top,
joined at the four vertical corners. Supports: every node at level 0 (Tekton Support Nodes).

Known: the wall-to-slab coupling is not found upstream (compas_timber frame bug),
so Preflight reports two parts and the slab rests on nothing - see examples/README.md.

Run: RFEM 6 must be running; the API key comes from the repo .env.</item>
